concept:australian-capital-territory-stamp-duty-amendment-act-1986-sec-2 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "2 Section 2"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-2 ;
    values:originalText "(1) Subject to sub-section (2), this Act shall come into operation on the first day of the month next following the month in which it receives the Royal Assent.  Australian Capital Territory Stamp Duty Amendment No. 147, 1986 (2) Paragraphs 4 (h) and 5 (c) and (d) and sub-section 6 (2) shall be deemed to have come into operation on 10 June 1986." ;
    skos:definition "(1) Subject to sub-section (2), this Act shall come into operation on the first day of the month next following the month in which it receives the Royal Assent.  Australian Capital Territory Stamp Duty Amendment No. 147, 1986 (2) Paragraphs 4 (h) and 5 (c) and (d) and sub-section 6 (2) shall be deemed to have come into operation on 10 June 1986."@en ;
