concept:australian-capital-territory-stamp-duty-amendment-act-1986-sec-6 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "6 Section 6"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-6 ;
    values:originalText "(1) The amendments made by this Act (other than paragraphs 4 (h) and 5 (c) and (d)) apply, in relation to duty on instruments, as follows: (a) in the case of an instrument being a Crown lease—to such an instrument the date of commencement of which specified in the lease is on or after the date of commencement of this sub-section; (b) in any other case—to an instrument executed on or after the date of commencement of this sub-section. (2) The amendments made by paragraphs 4 (h) and 5 (c) and (d) apply in relation to instruments executed on or after the date of commencement of this sub-section. NOTE" ;
    skos:definition "(1) The amendments made by this Act (other than paragraphs 4 (h) and 5 (c) and (d)) apply, in relation to duty on instruments, as follows: (a) in the case of an instrument being a Crown lease—to such an instrument the date of commencement of which specified in the lease is on or after the date of commencement of this sub-section; (b) in any other case—to an instrument executed on or after the date of commencement of this sub-section. (2) The amendments made by paragraphs 4 (h) and 5 (c) and (d) apply in relation to instruments executed on or after the date of commencement of this sub-section. NOTE"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "6db91cd837919a069a3ab20333749e1650704ae56f3f39a68f83afdaa6ca8e1b" ;
    cof:pageNumber "6"^^xsd:integer ;
