doc:sec-6-ss-1 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "6(1) Section 6" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(1) The amendments made by this Act (other than paragraphs 4 (h) and 5 (c) and (d)) apply, in relation to duty on instruments, as follows: (a) in the case of an instrument being a Crown lease—to such an instrument the date of commencement of which specified in the lease is on or after the date of commencement of this sub-section; (b) in any other case—to an instrument executed on or after the date of commencement of this sub-section." ;
    cof:pageNumber "6"^^xsd:integer .

